# What the production server should run (KVM 2, DNS on Hostinger, free sites AND agents' own domains on on-demand certificates).
# Source: 2026-10-21-LIVE-IN-AN-HOUR-RUNBOOK.md T+25 + ledger 10-26/10-27; the LIVE /etc/caddy/Caddyfile was not read when this was written.
# Compare it with the live file BEFORE touching anything (docs/CUSTOM-DOMAINS.md, step 1). deploy/Caddyfile is the later Cloudflare-wildcard variant.
#
# What own domains need from Caddy: the global `ask` (the app approves only its hosts + VERIFIED own domains at /_tls/ask), the
# `https://` catch-all with on_demand (serves www.<agent-domain> and the bare name), and the `http://` redirect.
# Do not add a named block for the brand domain here: fichaunica.mx and www are WordPress on Hostinger hosting.
{
	on_demand_tls {
		ask http://127.0.0.1:8640/_tls/ask
	}
}

http:// {
	redir https://{host}{uri} permanent
}

https:// {
	tls {
		on_demand
	}
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8640
}
